Experience owns channel adaptation
Capability owns business capability
Domain owns business rules
Integration owns connectivity
Core owns data


| Concern                        | Recommended Layer                      | Why                                            |
| ------------------------------ | -------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |
| Rate Limiting                  | API Gateway / Experience API           | Protect APIs from excessive client requests    |
| Authentication / Authorization | API Gateway + Experience API           | Validate caller identity before business logic |
| Circuit Breaker                | Capability API & Integration API       | Protect downstream services                    |
| Timeout                        | Capability API & Integration API       | Prevent long-running dependencies              |
| Retry                          | Integration API (sometimes Capability) | Retry transient failures only                  |
| Bulkhead                       | Capability API & Integration API       | Isolate failures between dependencies          |
| Caching                        | Capability API                         | Cache reusable business/reference data         |
| Idempotency                    | Capability API                         | Prevent duplicate business operations          |
| Observability                  | All layers                             | End-to-end tracing and monitoring              |




